    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i got this really big painful bump on my upper back and it's like super red and feels like it's full of fluid or something. it's throbbing and making it hard to sit comfortably. i was thinking about just using a sterile needle to pop it and drain it so it feels better, is that okay to do at home?",
