      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just being really careful though, i have an alcohol swab and a brand new needle that i just took out of the pack. it's not even that big, just like a marble. i dont want to spend $150 at urgent care for something i can just drain in two seconds. if i'm super careful with the sterilization, it's fine right? it'll just feel way better once the pressure is gone.",
